    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/b380322da3883752497a24039d5335b7.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lilycle is a fun, adorable, and relaxing game about six yuri couples (plus one main love triangle!) interacting and strengthening their feelings for each other. You mainly follow Yuno, Tamaki, and Saeka as they navigate their budding romance and pursue their other girls, admiring the precious moments between them and six other couples from the perspective of each cute girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/28369fc6d61621ef50aff87d5efb242e.poster.avif?t=1753232816\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/28369fc6d61621ef50aff87d5efb242e.webp?t=1753232816\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/e6055aa7f2fcf36b54e6d3b873876ed4.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every girl and every couple is unique in both character and dynamic, offering a wide variety of sweet and tender moments to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/67bb1093e3603032ccb9bf10211abe62.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience scenes from the point of view of each one of the 15 girls featured in this game, giving every one of them a chance to shine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/1ccca7740e1c5022318725183b648e47.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can enjoy the talents of a full cast of talented voice actresses such as Juri Kimura (<i>Shirobako</i>), MAO (<i>Flip Flappers, Keijo</i>), Haruka Terui (<i>Yuki Yuna is a Hero</i>), Shiori Mikami (<i>Attack on Titan, Yuru Yuri</i>), Azumi Asakura (<i>iDOLM@STER, High School DxD</i>), Maaya Uchida (<i>iDOLM@STER, Love Chunibyou &amp; Other Delusions</i>), Aya Uchida (<i>Love Live!, Danganronpa 2, Kemono Friends</i>), Rumi Okubo (<i>Fate/Apocrypha, </i>Y<i>uru Yuri</i>), Aya Suzaki (<i>Kill la Kill</i>,\u00a0<i>Tamako Market</i>), and more in this cute, slice-of-life about girls enjoying girls!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/249ded092ade5ee9cd0b31ecb2075c14.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playing through and viewing the chapters of these girls' stories through the calendar will steadily unlock new scenes to enjoy, sometimes from prior days too. Can you unlock each and every one of them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/09700def691bed586adeb447159af577.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy many detailed scenes and characters illustrated by Miwabe Sakura, illustrator for the light novel, &quot;<i>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</i>.&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/f33a10a9faa7e18fa78cd8815d36d0ac.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/7d9cb3e23748105277f4579030ee0cee.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/aa96828a48850688d2f21b83c20ab7df.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/9736eb459ee4fd0ab498b38166ba4385.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/d65e5d3f0f68fa41ed82a91de8e5f673.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/6b6de69293b7e099301f0ec8789dad82.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/79220066d6fc8647e3b73d8ddaa5abca.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/fecf524139388e98cfd6bdacc81b1ade.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/04a295dbd03a77506e8f3f6836b9b454.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/58ad5eec49e453cc840987ed997a9c16.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/cb9e4f0cc5034b1be5ac632234ad2c05.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/b380322da3883752497a24039d5335b7.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lilycle is a fun, adorable, and relaxing game about six yuri couples (plus one main love triangle!) interacting and strengthening their feelings for each other. You mainly follow Yuno, Tamaki, and Saeka as they navigate their budding romance and pursue their other girls, admiring the precious moments between them and six other couples from the perspective of each cute girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/28369fc6d61621ef50aff87d5efb242e.poster.avif?t=1753232816\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/28369fc6d61621ef50aff87d5efb242e.webp?t=1753232816\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/e6055aa7f2fcf36b54e6d3b873876ed4.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every girl and every couple is unique in both character and dynamic, offering a wide variety of sweet and tender moments to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/67bb1093e3603032ccb9bf10211abe62.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience scenes from the point of view of each one of the 15 girls featured in this game, giving every one of them a chance to shine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/1ccca7740e1c5022318725183b648e47.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can enjoy the talents of a full cast of talented voice actresses such as Juri Kimura (<i>Shirobako</i>), MAO (<i>Flip Flappers, Keijo</i>), Haruka Terui (<i>Yuki Yuna is a Hero</i>), Shiori Mikami (<i>Attack on Titan, Yuru Yuri</i>), Azumi Asakura (<i>iDOLM@STER, High School DxD</i>), Maaya Uchida (<i>iDOLM@STER, Love Chunibyou &amp; Other Delusions</i>), Aya Uchida (<i>Love Live!, Danganronpa 2, Kemono Friends</i>), Rumi Okubo (<i>Fate/Apocrypha, </i>Y<i>uru Yuri</i>), Aya Suzaki (<i>Kill la Kill</i>,\u00a0<i>Tamako Market</i>), and more in this cute, slice-of-life about girls enjoying girls!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/249ded092ade5ee9cd0b31ecb2075c14.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playing through and viewing the chapters of these girls' stories through the calendar will steadily unlock new scenes to enjoy, sometimes from prior days too. Can you unlock each and every one of them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/09700def691bed586adeb447159af577.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy many detailed scenes and characters illustrated by Miwabe Sakura, illustrator for the light novel, &quot;<i>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</i>.&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/f33a10a9faa7e18fa78cd8815d36d0ac.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/7d9cb3e23748105277f4579030ee0cee.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/aa96828a48850688d2f21b83c20ab7df.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/9736eb459ee4fd0ab498b38166ba4385.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/d65e5d3f0f68fa41ed82a91de8e5f673.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/6b6de69293b7e099301f0ec8789dad82.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/79220066d6fc8647e3b73d8ddaa5abca.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/fecf524139388e98cfd6bdacc81b1ade.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/04a295dbd03a77506e8f3f6836b9b454.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/978870/extras/58ad5eec49e453cc840987ed997a9c16.avif?t=1753232816\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src